(This report documents the design\054 implementation\054 and evaluation of the file transfer protocol\054 a) Tj
T*
(custom application\055layer protocol and its Python reference implementation\054 built for the Computer Networks programming) Tj
T*
(assignment\056 The system consists of a multi\055threaded TCP server and a companion client\054 together supporting user) Tj
T*
(authentication\054 private and broadcast messaging\054 direct file upload\057download to server\055side storage\054 and file transfer) Tj
T*
(between clients mediated by the server \050with delivery guaranteed even if the recipient is offline at send time\051\056) Tj
T*
