(The full protocol specification \055 message framing\054 the command set\054 error codes\054 and sequence diagrams for every) Tj
T*
(exchange \055 is documented separately in the accompanying Protocol Specification document and is not repeated here\056) Tj
T*
(This report instead focuses on the system\047s architecture\054 the implementation techniques used to realize the protocol over) Tj
T*
(raw TCP sockets\054 the concurrency model and the reasoning behind it\054 the experiments run to characterize performance\054) Tj
T*
(the challenges encountered during development\054 and the lessons drawn from the project\056) Tj
